03:27:00.000 --> 03:27:01.420
I take back what I said.

03:27:01.830 --> 03:27:05.730
With a little polishing, Alan B. Beardsley could really be something.

03:27:06.540 --> 03:27:10.110
One more thing to get all excited about, right, Domon?

03:27:30.000 --> 03:27:34.640
Chibity's next opponent is Jester Gundam, piloted by a clown.

03:27:34.640 --> 03:27:38.600
The crew members watch helplessly as this chameleon faunts with his haunting laugh.

03:27:38.600 --> 03:27:44.600
However, they remind him of a story from his past that gives Chibity the courage he desperately needs.

03:27:44.600 --> 03:27:48.660
Next on Mobile Fighter G Gundam, dazzling power of the clown.

03:27:48.660 --> 03:27:51.260
Get mad, Gundam Master.

03:27:51.260 --> 03:27:53.490
Ready, go!

03:29:06.750 --> 03:29:07.300
She

03:29:32.200 --> 03:29:34.900
I'll keep living
